<!-- 7.x's look of the boards and mail (its XML twin's layout; boards.lua draws with it), from Source-5's class pages
     (the EPF layout). Format: core/xml.md; each dialog's attributes are its look entry's values (interfaces/xml/entry.lua), its
     children where boards.lua draws its parts: rectangles (left, top, right, bottom), lists (the rectangle, the cell's
     width and height), the window's picture (DLGBBSnn.EPF, its palette the same name's .PAL) and its image buttons (the
     control's index, BUTT001.EPF's image id, the top left: 63 x 24 each).
     WIRE: a control's rectangle is where a press on it lands (DialogPane::HitTestControls 0x0049FB10); and the lists'
     rows and rectangles decide when a list shows its end, so when the client asks for older mail or articles (3B 02:
     boards.lua's BoardList). Changing them changes what the client sends. -->
<ui>
