       the title; the board's title in 0x25); the rows' columns (ArticleListPane::DrawListEntry 0x00474F90, MailListPane's
       0x0047AE50): "%5d" the id, from x 35 the author fitted to 80 pixels, from 110 the date, from 150 the subject fitted
       to 208. WIRE: the rows' 14 pixels and the rectangles' heights (the mail's 280, the articles' 272) decide when a
